## The mutants

Each mutant changed one line of `dashboard/lib/storytime/print/card-kit.ts`, ran the adversarial file only, and was restored from a copy.

- Mutant F53: the line `if (third.trim() === '') return 'none';` was changed back to `if (third === '') return 'none';`. X-P8-14 failed with the error "expected 'picture' to be 'none'". Exit 1, 1 failed and 5 passed. Capture: `green-p8-r14-mutant-F53.txt`.
- Mutant F54: the body of `matchLabel` was changed from `return label.replace(/[\s\u0000-\u001f\u007f-\u009f]+/g, ' ');` to `return label;`. X-P8-15 failed with the error "the report file holds one line for each card: expected [ ...(5) ] to have a length of 3 but got 5". Exit 1, 1 failed and 5 passed. Capture: `green-p8-r14-mutant-F54.txt`.
- Mutant F55: the pattern `STICKER_CENTRE_PATTERN` was changed back from `/^\d+(\.\d+)?%[ \t\n\f\r]+\d+(\.\d+)?%$/` to `/^\d+(\.\d+)?%\s+\d+(\.\d+)?%$/`. X-P8-16 failed with the error "expected '20% 80%' to be '50% 50%'". Exit 1, 1 failed and 5 passed. Capture: `green-p8-r14-mutant-F55.txt`.

Each file came back byte for byte. The check `cmp` against the copy and the empty check `git diff` against the committed file both passed. The adversarial file after the three restores exits 0 with 6 tests passed.

